  <iati-identifier>GB-GOV-1-301457-441</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reflecting interests of K-Serbs to formulate policy proposals - Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to support the process of integration of the Serb community into the Kosovo constitutional framework by developing tailored policy proposals that address the most critical issues associated with this process. This projects builds on the British Embassy funded project in FY 23/24, &apos;The Needs of the Kosovo-Serb Community in the Process of normalisation of Relations between Serbia and Kosovo,&apos; published in September 2023, which identified the basic needs of the Serb community in Kosovo and produced a study with a series of recommendations. This project will use those recommendations, focussing on three key issues (security, protection of cultural heritage, and access to documents), and further engagement with citizens, to draft policy proposals that will support the full integration of the Serb community into a stable and democratic Kosovo. The policy proposals will be shared with the Government of Kosovo and international diplomatic corps.</narrative>
  </description>
